# NotesApp example

This folder is the iOS/Android demo app. The library is `../..` (`src/`, `native/`).

```bash
cd examples/NotesApp
yarn expo run:ios
maestro test maestro/
```

Before `expo run:*` or `yarn start`, check Metro on port **8081** is already running (terminals, `lsof -i :8081`, or `curl -s http://localhost:8081/status`). Reuse it — do not start a second dev server.

App id: `com.nitromelondb.example`. Not Expo Go. Rebuild after native changes.
